## sn22.4
sn22.4:1.1 | S: So I have heard. | T: Thus have I heard.
sn22.4:1.2 | S: At one time Venerable Mahākaccāna was staying in the land of the Avantis near Kuraraghara on Steep Mountain. | T: On one occasion the Venerable Mahakaccana was dwelling among the people of Avanti on Mount Papata at Kuraraghara.
